  getzep/graphiti (fact extraction and contradiction prompts)
  https://github.com/getzep/graphiti (commit b8ea9c5dcba4b0031c9c204f733bcd7ad5e2dadc)
  Copyright 2024, Zep Software, Inc.

  The design of the bible fact prompt (Phase 4.1, src/lib/facts/prompt.ts) is
  PORTED from graphiti's prompts: fact extraction as in
  graphiti_core/prompts/extract_edges.py (facts about named entities, every
  concrete detail kept, no inferred time) and contradiction detection as in
  graphiti_core/prompts/dedupe_edges.py (`resolve_edge`: the new fact judged
  against the existing facts shown, numbered, and the ones it contradicts
  named "only when the new fact and the existing fact cannot both be true"),
  folded into one call and adapted to a book's bible; some rule wording is
  paraphrased or quoted from those files. Deduplication is not ported (it is
  code), and no graph database is used: facts are stored in PostgreSQL. No
  graphiti code is imported, linked or redistributed, and it is not a
  dependency of this project. The project is distributed under the Apache
  License, Version 2.0: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

